FIDELITY FIXES FOUND BY THE TESTS
---------------------------------
- control_panel.cpp:445 source rect is one row TALLER than the button
  (size.height+1). The first port omitted it; the test now pins it and the code
  matches upstream.
- InvDrawSlotBack has NO source buffer: it recolours pixels already drawn at the
  target (inv.cpp:1149-1158). The first port modelled it as a panel-buffer copy,
  which read out of the panel-local coordinate space. Now a BlitTint flavour that
  carries a size and no buffer.

