SCOPE HELD
----------
No input routing, no inventory item logic, no automap, no chat, no text/fonts
(bean v1hy), no new deps. CLX panel art decode needed nothing beyond cel.go's
CelFrame shape, so no STOP condition fired.

Residual:
- The panel/flask/belt art loading (ctrlpan\\panel8, p8bulbs, cursor cels from the
  MPQ pipeline) is not wired: this lane is the geometry + draw-command layer.
- Party panel (partypanel.cpp), XP bar (DrawXPBar) and the flask value text
  (DrawFlaskValues) are out of contract — text is bean v1hy's.
- DrawMainPanelButtonsMultiplayer is ported but unwired: single-player mode is the
  only caller until the multiplayer bean lands.
